  "hello_lens": {
    "_doc": "Optional additive hello field (2026-09-30). Receivers log it and ignore unknown hello fields; a missing or malformed lens never rejects the hello. kind is 'wide' or 'standard'; focal_mm is the shortest LENS_INFO_AVAILABLE_FOCAL_LENGTHS value; hfov_deg is 2*atan(sensor long edge / (2*focal_mm)) over SENSOR_INFO_PHYSICAL_SIZE. Both rounded to 0.1.",
