  "cert_pins": {
    "_doc": "pin = 'sha256/' + base64url-without-padding(SHA-256(certificate DER)). DER hash, not SPKI (D-341 9, rejected alternative 'SPKI hash'). 'der_utf8' stands in for DER bytes: hash its UTF-8 encoding. The phone accepts a wss:// chain only when one certificate in the served chain has this pin; the pinned certificate is the trust anchor and the leaf must chain to it with hostname verification still on.",
